<title>UK: LIFFE sugar ends week on firm note.</title>
<headline>LIFFE sugar ends week on firm note.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE sugar futures remained steadier in late Friday evening trading, with the market extending earlier gains to end the week on a firm note.</p>
<p>Traders said gains in New York underpinned the London market, although conditions here were fairly low-key, with turnover swollen by AA trades.</p>
<p>May ended the session at $307.60 a tonne, up $3.10 from Thursday. Turnover was 1,400 lots.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
